# Project overview

This is a greenfield, single-business e-commerce app using Next.js App Router, TypeScript and Supabase.

MVP:
- Public product/category storefront and search
- Customer auth, profile/address, cart, checkout and order history
- Cash on delivery only
- Admin product/category/order/store-settings management
- Admins are provisioned manually

Explicitly excluded: multi-store marketplace, drivers, GPS tracking, driver dashboards, online payments, microservices and unnecessary enterprise abstractions.

Keep the code readable and easy to explain in a software engineering course. Prefer the simplest design that satisfies security and correctness. Do not add dependencies or abstractions without a concrete reason.

Course mapping:
Route Handler → Controller → Service → Repository → Supabase.
